  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The fcrepo-module-auth-rbacl module has a compile-time dependency on fcrepo-kernel-modeshape, but that dependency is not made explicit in the maven configuration. Instead, it is retrieved transitively via fcrepo-http-api (which eventually will not have a transitive dependency on fcrepo-kernel-modeshape).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is incorrect, and the maven configuration should list fcrepo-kernel-modeshape as a direct dependency (since it is).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
