  "description": "<p>The fcrepo-module-auth-rbacl module has a compile-time dependency on fcrepo-kernel-modeshape, but that dependency is not made explicit in the maven configuration. Instead, it is retrieved transitively via fcrepo-http-api (which eventually will not have a transitive dependency on fcrepo-kernel-modeshape).</p>\n\n<p>This is incorrect, and the maven configuration should list fcrepo-kernel-modeshape as a direct dependency (since it is).</p>",
